  "text": "- Home\n- /Products\n- /AR Smart Glasses\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCNPS.AI\n\n# AR Smart Glasses\nWear the screen instead of holding it. These augmented-reality glasses project a crisp digital display directly into your line of sight using diffractive optical lenses, so information floats in front of you while the world stays clearly visible behind it.\n$1,599.00$1,299.00 USD\nBuy on shop.cnps.ai\nCheckout is on shop.cnps.ai. This site does not take payments.\n\n\n## Listed variants\n\n\n | Option | Price | Was\n | AR Smart Glasses | $1,299.00 | $1,599.00\n\n\n## From the shop listing\nSKUCNPS-PVG1\nVendorCNPS.AI\nDisplay typeDiffractive optical lens micro-display\nLens coatingAnti-glare / anti-reflective\nProcessorQuad-core ARM, 1.5 GHz\nAudioDual stereo speakers, directional sound\nControlCapacitive touch panel on temple\nLanguage support40 languages, 90 accents\nConnectivityPhones, tablets, desktop systems\n\n\nThe frame stays close to the size and weight of a standard pair of prescription glasses, so they sit comfortably for everyday wear rather than feeling like a headset. A touch-sensitive panel on the temple lets you navigate with a single swipe. Dual stereo speakers deliver spatial sound aimed at your ears alone, so calls, audio and notifications stay private without earbuds. Inside, a quad-core 1.5 GHz ARM processor keeps the interface smooth and power-efficient, with software that understands 40 languages across 90 accents.\n\n- Glasses-first design — close to the size and weight of regular eyewear for all-day comfort.\n- Diffractive optical display — high light efficiency with an anti-glare coating for a clear image, even outdoors.\n- One-swipe touch control — a touch panel on the temple replaces buttons.\n- Private directional stereo — dual speakers send spatial audio to you only; no earbuds needed.\n- Quad-core 1.5 GHz ARM processor — smooth multitasking with low power draw.\n- 40 languages / 90 accents — broad voice and translation support.\n- Broad device compatibility — pairs with phones, tablets and desktop systems.",
